Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 16:57:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 37/53] media: i2c: add GalaxyCore GC02M2 sensor driver

Add a V4L2 subdevice driver for the GC02M2 front-camera sensor. Support
the PineTab-V 1600x1200 raw Bayer mode, controls, runtime power
sequencing, and serialized streaming state with complete error rollback.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
